<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="15.2" level="1">Counties, Cities and Towns</unit>
		<unit label="subtitle" identifier="IV" level="2">Other Governmental Entities</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="62" level="3">Alleghany Highlands Economic Development Authority</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>15.2-6209</section_number>
	<catch_line>Capitalization of Authority</catch_line>
	<text>
		On or before January 1, 1994, and on or before the first day of each year thereafter, each county and town that is a member of the Authority may remit to the Authority an amount it deems appropriate for Authority purposes.
	</text>
	<history>1993, c. 982, § 15.1-1670; 1997, c. 587; 2005, c. 671; 2006, c. 861.</history>
</law>
